OL,3,GNEWSA'We're putting virtual Oxford on
OL,4,Athe map in Roblox'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pair of young game designers are
OL,7,Fhelping to put a virtual version of
OL,8,FOxford on the map, after they recreated
OL,9,Fthe city in the popular game Roblox.
OL,11,FOxford Roleplay lets users undertake
OL,12,Feveryday jobs in a digital version of
OL,13,Fthe city of dreaming spires, complete
OL,14,Fwith iconic landmarks including Carfax
OL,15,FTower and Folly Bridge.
OL,17,FThe game, which people can find within
OL,18,FRoblox, has been played by more than
OL,19,F7.4 million people since its launch in
OL,20,FAugust 2025.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
